# PostgreSQL connection string for Prisma. Leave unset in local dev if you
# just want to look at the UI — the app renders a "Database not connected
# yet" state instead of crashing (see lib/db.ts). Set it, then run
# `npx prisma migrate dev` to create the tables, to actually save data.
#
# Example (Vercel Postgres / Neon / Supabase / local Postgres all work):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname?schema=public"
DATABASE_URL=
